    "detailed_description": "In this interactive adventure, you play as a teacher suffering from delirium tremens. A world will open before you where every choice you make matters. Explore different locations, engage in battles, make decisions that will correspond to your desires and moral principles. Go on a shopping spree where you can purchase a variety of items that will then be used in your adventure. Have fun by going bowling or going to the cinema. <br />\r\n     The game offers 18 different outcomes, each of which is a unique ending to your journey. One of the endings will not only complete your current story, but will also unlock a new character with whom you can begin your next adventure.",
